Subject: [PATCH 4/6] The series panel's note keeps its first claim whole and
 adds the real series after it

Saying the real series' later seasons in the same breath had split "the game's simulation for series it invents, never a
published figure", the words tests/b27-audience.test.ts holds the panel to and the claim the note makes first; the real
series now follow it as a clause of their own, and the sentence says the same two things.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HBdcuKzBBMbipfFQSByALG
